{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了～大、大家請回到座位上……」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0079", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼本週的長班會要開始囉！」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0080", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "本週的長班會是選在第６節。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "萬智老師進到教室，我跟瀨名同學一起站在台前。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為班級幹部，我們也擔任主持。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「跟新吾君站在一起……好～要加油囉萬智！」", "text_idx": 5, "plain": "「跟新吾君站在一起……好～要加油囉萬智！」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0081", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今、今天的議題，總之就是考試的事。」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0082", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。如同大家所知，期中考試快要到了。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0265", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊。」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0083", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學率先點出了主題。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在班級幹部會的時候我就這麼想了，身為搭檔，瀨名同學的這種地方真的很可靠。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「下下週的星期二，２７日起連續４天。雖然由於合併試辦的緣故，環境跟考試期間也跟著改變了──」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0266", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是被選為結女代表的我們，成績不可以因此而考差。」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0267", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「繃緊神經，確實地用功念書吧！」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0268", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好～」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "結女學生們", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "go031", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔，全部都被瀨名同學說完了……不，應該說她做得比我更好……唉呼。」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0084", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0269", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……當然我們各務台的學生也是。為了不要扯班級後腿，認真念書吧！」", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也連忙接著說。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為瀨名同學率先發言了，所以我必須好好地收尾。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……雖然話是這麼說，但我一點自信也沒有就是了。沒問題吧？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "相較於瀨名同學始終正經的發言，我則是在最後稍微耍寶了一下。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "似乎成功緩和了氣氛，這讓我鬆了口氣。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，總之加油吧，拜託大家了。」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，新吾君……我也會加油……！」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0085", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們班的兩位班級幹部都很可靠，讓老師很安心！」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 278, "voice": "mc0086", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「萬智老師也做點事啦～」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "sn0057", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只有老師一個人處在輕鬆隱居模式呢～」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 257, "voice": "ag0208", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0270", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "儘管臨近期中考試，對我來說依然是把該做的事一件件完成而已。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「焚燒爐在這裡。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0271", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放學後，還是跟瀨名同學做班級幹部的工作。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但我真的沒想到，連「代替請假的同學當值日生」這種事也要做就是了。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還是說，這是瀨名同學主動接下幫忙的嗎？", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0272", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、沒有沒有……只是和那時相反呢。這次是我讓瀨名同學帶路了。」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在熟悉的地方我不會迷路。那個時候是例外，不要再提了。」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝妳帶我來，幫了我很大的忙。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之微笑，然後向她道謝。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然我大概掌握校內環境了，不過還沒去過焚燒爐，所以才請她帶路。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這也是工作。」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學移開視線，語氣冷漠地說。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈。」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「無緣無故就笑的人，我不喜歡。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已經知道地點了吧，我先回去了。我還有其他工作。」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她帶著不悅的表情快步離開了。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哎呀哎呀。」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我聳了聳肩膀。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，趕快丟完垃圾回去找瀨名同學吧……", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結束打掃後，接著是整理資料的工作。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和瀨名同學待在沒有其他人的教室裡，面對面坐著埋頭工作。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管完成多少，工作都不會減少呢……」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我們班是以至今為止都沒有的形式運作的班級，剛起步這也是沒辦法的。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一邊回答，瀨名同學的手也沒有停下。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不對，應該說她回答的時候又更加速工作了。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "筆尖沙沙沙地不停滑動，當我注意到時她已經完成比我多好幾倍的量了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過到期中考前應該就會告一段落了。給學生增加這麼多負擔就本末倒置了。」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……所以這星期就撐一下的感覺？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的確，對學校來說，應該會讓考試前的學生專心念書才對。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不然會讓人很困擾的。」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學最後小聲地這麼回答後就不再開口，我也跟著沉默。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結束了。」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君還沒好吧。那不好意思我先走了。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 258, "voice": "ar0281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，比我提早許多做完工作的瀨名同學，就像往常一樣先回家了。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哎呀哎呀。」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 263, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
